{"id":923,"depth":60,"text":924},{"id":966,"depth":54,"text":967},{"id":1012,"depth":54,"text":1013},{"id":1072,"depth":54,"text":1749},"mdbook for Standalone Docs",{"id":1135,"depth":54,"text":1136},{"id":1242,"depth":54,"text":1243},{"id":1269,"depth":54,"text":1270},{"id":1337,"depth":54,"text":1338},{"id":1423,"depth":54,"text":1424},{"id":1538,"depth":54,"text":1539},{"id":1636,"depth":54,"text":1699},"Documentation is part of the Rust culture. rustdoc produces HTML docs from \u002F\u002F\u002F comments; doc-tests run examples.","md",{},true,"\u002Frust\u002F32-documentation",{"title":5,"description":1757},"rust\u002F32-documentation","WeeSYq6Go7nJvEjaZYCGpB9WEcoX8cVTomqTGHlJz3k",1787401244619]